<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's 1997 EPS estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's 1997 EPS estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it raised its Harrah's Entertainment Inc 1997 earnings estimates to $1.32 from $1.25 after the company announced a 10.3 million share buyback.</p>
<p>-- Harrah's was given a near-term price target of $23 and a 12-month price target of $30, according to a research report.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 18-3/8.</p>
</text>
